#X obj 560 906 expr tanh(wa1_\$0*x1_\$0 + wb1_\$0*x2_\$0 + hb1_\$0) \; tanh(wa2_\$0*x1_\$0 + wb2_\$0*x2_\$0 + hb2_\$0) \; tanh(wa3_\$0*x1_\$0 + wb3_\$0*x2_\$0 + hb3_\$0), f 60;
